Subject: [PATCH] net: mediatek: adapt official manual HNAT API fixes to R4 baseline

Port MediaTek c2b24b4806e78af3ea403e3a6668871abea5ddb2 on top of the
24.10 network baseline used by this target, rather than the superseded
files-6.12 driver. Keep accounting owners coherent across metadata updates
and deletion, protect callback loads and invocation with RCU, and serialize
legacy MIB read-clear transactions without nesting the ledger lock.

The API source/header carry the upstream API fixes. Reconnect them after
the baseline patch so the corrected API is actually compiled and linked.

